<!--
    The launcher mark: the Sendspin S with the Android robot head as
    its top curve.

    The two thick arcs of the Sendspin logo form an S cut in two. The
    top arc is replaced here by the rounded head of the Android robot,
    tilted to the same angle: the flat chin of the head sits on the
    chord that the arc once cut, so the head carries the curve's flow
    into the Sendspin arcs below it. The four small corner brackets of
    the logo stay, so the mark still reads as the Sendspin S.

    The paths carry the coordinates of the original logo SVG
    (115 x 94), and the group below scales the composition into the
    circle that every launcher mask keeps visible. The head is drawn
    white over the brand colour background; the eyes are holes in the
    dome, so the background shows through them, and the monochrome
    layer of the themed icon renders them the same way.
-->
